say|KUSAKAM|What is that? I don't understand what's going on down there...
say|KUSAKAM|Who are those people? Why are they walking like that?
say|KUSAKAM|But something tells me I have to go there.
say|KUSAKAM|Something's wrong. I can feel it deep inside.
say|KUSAKAM|I don't know why, but I have to run to the village!
say|KUSAKAM|I have to run there right now!
